<title>SWITZERLAND: Ascom sells pneumatic tube unit.</title>
<headline>Ascom sells pneumatic tube unit.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE, Switzerland 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecommunications group Ascom Holding AG said it had sold German unit Ascom GCT GmbH, which makes pneumatic tube mail systems, in a management buy-out.</p>
<p>An Ascom statement said the move was part of its continued program of focusing on core business.</p>
<p>Ascom said GCT, renamed Aerocom GmbH &amp; Co after the September 30 sale, had 1995 revenue of 27 million Swiss francs and a workforce of 170.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
